The render does not supply confirmed prices, certificates/files, film media, FAQ answers, account/configurator/checkout services, or final action destinations. Local controls open explanatory modal dialogs instead of fabricated checkout or documents. All translated copy and product claims need product approval before publication. See [PRODUCT.md](PRODUCT.md) for specific claims and flows.

